20:["$","p","This tool retains the exact 2/3 multiplier internally for quarter-to-semester arithmetic and rounds the display to two decimal places. Do not treat the display rounding as the receiving school's recording policy.",{"children":"This tool retains the exact 2/3 multiplier internally for quarter-to-semester arithmetic and rounds the display to two decimal places. Do not treat the display rounding as the receiving school's recording policy."}]
